# T-078: every install goes through the stand's own Verdaccio, not just the @normwerk/* scope —
# Verdaccio's own default config proxies anything it doesn't have locally to the real npm registry
# (verdaccio/config.yaml, "uplinks"), so this is a real `npm install`, not a workspace link (plan-e2e.md §2).
# Overridden by the harness/Dockerfile at build time to point at the compose network's own verdaccio:4873.
registry=http://verdaccio:4873/
